@startuml sl-04-bom-operations
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Flow 4 — Business Operations Management, Pricing Policy & Revenue Analytics

|Business Operations Manager|
start
:Access BOM Management Portal;

fork
  :Manage Master Unit Types & Standards (BM-01);
  :Define unit dimensions (length, width, height, volume);
  :Set standard base price catalog (BR-PRI-01);
  :Publish Master Unit Type updates;
fork again
  :Configure Regional Facility Pricing Overrides (BM-02);
  :Select target facility & unit types;
  :Set location-adjusted rental rates (BR-PRI-02);
  :Create new FacilityUnitTypePriceVersion record (immutable history) (BR-PRI-03);
  :Publish updated facility price catalog;
fork again
  :Create Discount Programs & Seasonal Promotions (BM-05);
  :Define discount percentage, valid date range, and applicable facilities;
  :Activate promotional campaign;
fork again
  :Manage System Operating Policies (BM-04);
  :Adjust overdue grace period, penalty rates, or buffer days;
  :Publish new PolicyVersion;
end fork

|System|
:Persist policy and pricing version updates in database;
:Apply effective pricing to all new reservations and quote calculations;

|Business Operations Manager|
:Access Revenue & Facility Performance Analytics Hub (BM-03);

|System|
:Query live contracts, payments, and facility occupancy data;
:Compute four-stream revenue breakdown (Rental, Deposit, Overdue Penalties, Extra Fees);
:Calculate Facility Occupancy Rate and Unit Usage Rate (BM-03);
note right
  **Operational Metrics (BM-03):**
  Usage Rate = Total Occupied Units / Total Capacity
  Revenue = Realized Rental + Penalties + Additional Services
end note

|Business Operations Manager|
:Inspect interactive revenue charts, occupancy comparisons, and facility KPI scorecards;
:Export financial performance report (Excel / CSV / PDF);
stop
@enduml
